{"cid": 580159, "verse": 2, "clause_idx_in_verse": 0, "typ": "NmCl", "domain": "", "rela": "", "head_verb_lemma": "", "head_verb_text": "", "text": "כִּ֤י אִ֥ם בְּתֹורַ֥ת יְהוָ֗ה חֶ֫פְצֹ֥ו"}
